# Skills location

- **Source of truth**: put all skill source under `.claude/skills/<skill-name>/`
- **Cursor discovery**: `.cursor/skills/<skill-name>` must be a **symlink** to `../../.claude/skills/<skill-name>`
- **Global Claude Code**: `~/.claude/skills/<skill-name>` must be a **symlink** to `$(repo-root)/.claude/skills/<skill-name>` (absolute path)
- Do **not** keep a second copy of skill files under `.cursor/skills/`
- **New / moved skills**: write in `.claude/skills/`, then add **both** symlinks below

```bash
# From repo root
SKILL=my-skill
ln -sf ../../.claude/skills/$SKILL .cursor/skills/$SKILL
ln -sf "$(pwd)/.claude/skills/$SKILL" ~/.claude/skills/$SKILL
```

```bash
# ✅ GOOD
.claude/skills/my-skill/SKILL.md
.cursor/skills/my-skill -> ../../.claude/skills/my-skill
~/.claude/skills/my-skill -> /path/to/keyword-kits/.claude/skills/my-skill

# ❌ BAD
.cursor/skills/my-skill/SKILL.md   # real copy
.claude/skills/my-skill -> ../../.cursor/skills/my-skill  # reverse symlink
# missing ~/.claude/skills/my-skill  # skill not globally available
```
